026年10月1日付「株式会社成電社の株式取得（子会社化）完了 及び連結子会社の役員人事に関するお知らせ」にて公表いたしました通り、株式会社成電社の完全子会社化に伴い、同社の業績が当社の2027年3月期の連結決算に反映されることとなったことなどから、業績予想を上回る見通しとなりました。　今後業績予想の修正が必要であると判断した場合は、速やかにお知らせいたします。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "PreviousReportingDateOfDividendForecast", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "（2026年4月28日発表）", null, "CurrentYearInstant_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 57, "57.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 57, "57.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 114, "114.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_PreviousMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 58, "58.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "予想", 115, "115.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ForecastMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "当期", 57, "57.00", "JPYPerShares", "CurrentYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 57, "57.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_SecondQuarterMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 57, "57.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_YearEndMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["1株当たり配当額", "DividendPerShare", "tse-ed-t", "前期", 114, "114.00", "JPYPerShares", "PriorYearDuration_AnnualMember_NonConsolidatedMember_CurrentMember_ResultMember"], ["ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "ReasonForDividendForecastCorrection", "tse-ed-t", "当期", null, "当社グループは、企業体質の一層の充実・強化を図り、業績に裏づけされた安定的且つ継続的な配当を株主の皆様 へ行うことを経営の重要課題と考えております。　この度の業績修正を踏まえ、当期の期末配当金を前回予想の57.00円から1.00円増額し、一株当たり58.00円とさせていただく予定です。※上記の業績予想は、本資料発表日現在において入手可能な情報に基づき作成したものであり、実際の業績は今後様々な要因によって予想数値と異なる場合があります。", null, "CurrentYearDuration"], ["FiscalYearEnd", "FiscalYearEnd", "tse-ed-t", "当期末", null, "2027-03-31", null, "CurrentYearInstant"]]}}